    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Grattan Lodge is a modern cul-de-sac development of attractive, spacious 4 and 5-bedroom semi-detached family homes, set within a cleverly designed residential scheme incorporating two generous green open spaces, providing an ideal environment for families and children to enjoy.\r\n\r\nThis mature and highly convenient location is situated just off the Hole in the Wall Road, with a host of local amenities and services within easy walking distance. The area is exceptionally well served by both primary and secondary schools, while Donaghmede and Clarehall Shopping Centres are also close by. The M50 and M1 motorways are readily accessible, as is Dublin Airport, making this an ideal location for commuters and families alike.\r\n\r\nNo. 116 is an exceptional family home which has been refurbished and modernised by the current owners with great flair, style and meticulous attention to detail. Presented in excellent condition throughout, this beautiful home offers bright, spacious and exceptionally well-appointed accommodation extending to approximately 130 sq. m., excluding the converted attic.\r\n\r\nOn entering, you are greeted by a welcoming reception hallway with convenient cloakroom and guest WC. To the front is a well-proportioned living room, while to the rear lies the real heart of the home — an impressive open-plan kitchen, dining and living space. This superb room is flooded with natural light from the skylights and benefits from direct access to the beautifully landscaped rear garden.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, a generous landing leads to four well-proportioned bedrooms, with the main bedroom featuring a stylish ensuite. A modern family bathroom completes the first-floor accommodation. There is also a staircase from the landing leading to a converted attic space, currently used as a store room, with the added benefit of a separate shower room.\r\n\r\nThe quality and attention to detail throughout this home are immediately apparent. Features include a stunning contemporary kitchen with a large central island, attractive built-in shelving in the living room, modern fitted wardrobes, stylish and recently updated bathroom suites, and a low-maintenance rear garden complete with artificial lawn.\r\n\r\nThis is a superb turnkey family home, combining generous accommodation, contemporary finishes and a convenient location within a mature and established development.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the quality, space and excellent standard of presentation this exceptional home has to offer."
      },
      {
