        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 5.62m x 1.85m \r\n\r\n\r\nLiving Room - 5.73m x 3.89m \r\n\r\n\r\nKitchen/ Dining Room - 7.2m x 5.82m \r\n\r\n\r\nUtility Room - \r\n\r\n\r\nWC - \r\n\r\n\r\nStore - \r\n\r\n\r\nLanding - 3.42m x 2.29m \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.93m x 3.46m \r\n\r\n\r\nEn-Suite - 0.95m x 2.56m \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.34m x 2.86m \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 2.89m x 2.96m \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 - 2.73m x 2.27m \r\n\r\n\r\nBathroom - 1.59m x 2.05m \r\n\r\n\r\nHot Press - \r\n\r\n\r\nAttic Room - 4.86m x 4.74m \r\n\r\n\r\nUnder Eave Storage - \r\n\r\n\r\nShower Room - 1.9m x 2.17m \r\n\r\n\r\n"
