      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tExceptional 4-bedroom semi-detached family home in a mature and popular cul-de-sac development.\r\n\r\n•\tBER B3\r\n\r\n•\tA wide range of local amenities and services within easy walking distance.\r\n\r\n•\tExcellent choice of primary and secondary schools close by.\r\n\r\n•\tConvenient to Donaghmede and Clarehall Shopping Centres.\r\n\r\n•\tEasy access to the M50 and M1 motorways.\r\n\r\n•\tDublin Airport is also within easy reach.\r\n\r\n•\tBright and spacious accommodation extending to approximately 130 sq. m., excluding the converted attic.\r\n\r\n•\tStunning contemporary kitchen with large central island.\r\n\r\n•\tSkylights provide excellent natural light to the open-plan living space.\r\n\r\n•\tConverted attic providing a useful additional store room, together with a separate shower room.\r\n\r\n•\tAttractive built-in shelving in the living room.\r\n\r\n•\tGas-fired central heating.\r\n\r\n•\tDouble-glazed UPVC windows.\r\n\r\n•\tLow-maintenance, easy-care landscaped rear garden with artificial lawn.\r\n\r\n•\tTurnkey property requiring little or no further expenditure.\r\n\r\n•\tA superb home combining space, style, quality and convenience."
